(Chapter 3: Payroll Schedule & Compensation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Salaries are distributed bi-weekly on alternate Fridays via electronic direct deposit.) Tj T*
(If a scheduled payday falls on an official national banking holiday, funds are) Tj T*
(transferred on the immediately preceding business day.) Tj T*
