(Chapter 4: Health, Dental & Vision Insurance Benefits) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Comprehensive medical, dental, and vision insurance coverage commences on the first) Tj T*
(day of the month following the hire date. Acme covers 80% of individual medical premiums) Tj T*
(and 60% of family dependent premiums. Open enrollment occurs annually in November.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
