(Chapter 5: Professional Development & Tuition Subsidy) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Acme encourages continuous learning. Regular employees who complete one year of service) Tj T*
(are eligible for up to $2,500 annually in tuition reimbursement for accredited degree) Tj T*
(programs, technical certifications, or approved industry conferences.) Tj T*
