(Chapter 6: Health, Safety & Emergency Protocols) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Safety is our collective responsibility. All office facilities maintain automated external) Tj T*
(defibrillators \(AED\) and first aid kits on each floor. In the event of a fire alarm or) Tj T*
(evacuation notice, exit calmly via stairwells to designated outdoor assembly points.) Tj T*
ET
