(ACME EMPLOYEE HANDBOOK) Tj T*
(Chapter 11: Attendance Tracking and Calculation) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(11.1 Attendance Calculation Methodology) Tj T*
(Attendance is calculated based on automated electronic badge swipes at office entry turnstiles) Tj T*
(and active single sign-on \(SSO\) login sessions on corporate laptops. Full-time personnel are) Tj T*
(expected to complete 40 accountable working hours per week.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(11.2 Grace Periods and Late Arrival) Tj T*
(A standard 15-minute grace period is provided for morning check-ins. If an employee arrives) Tj T*
(more than 30 minutes after standard shift start without prior supervisor notice, it is logged) Tj T*
(as an unscheduled late arrival. Three unscheduled late arrivals in a calendar month trigger an informal review.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
